A '''Frog Man''' is a {{Rarity|c|nolink=y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from [[Hotspot]]s in water.

== Spawning ==
A '''Frog Man''' can be fished up from any [[Hotspot]] in water. It requires {{skl|fishing|5}} or higher to be fished up.

[[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] have a {{Green|15%}} base chance to override other Sea Creature spawns. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

