The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Frog Man''' is {{Green|5,000}}, resulting in a catch chance of {{Chance|50.00%|1|2|sea creatures}} in [[Sea Creatures#Hotspot|Hotspot Sea Creatures]] pool with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Certain modifiers can be used to increase it:

